From 3deb46135bd149dfa72a5f08551f7e572604e47b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:35:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] test(web): adapt client and e2e suites after workflow removal

- delete 16 workflow client suites plus the workflow e2e spec
- drop the workflow blocks that only borrowed workflow sources: notification
  click targets, global pending actions (workflow mock, socket handlers,
  approval/sound/profile-switch suites), style system, drawer resize seams,
  ekko display name, i18n coverage (workflow schedule keys), page sidebar
  tab order and the workflow schedule UI test
- retarget suites that need a generic fixture: api error mapping now uses
  the conversations endpoint and the non-chat route sample uses history
- drop the workflow mocks/options from the shared e2e API fixtures and the
  macOS workflow gutter spec
